"údaj `KS:` v správe pre príjemcu."

#. module: l10n_cssk_payment_symbols_payment_order
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_payment_symbols_payment_order.field_account_payment_line__specific_symbol
msgid ""
"Czech/Slovak payment Specific Symbol (SS). Up to 10 digits. If empty, falls "
"back to a `SS:` token in the communication."
msgstr ""
"Špecifický symbol platby (ŠS). Najviac 10 číslic. Ak je prázdny, použije sa "
"údaj `SS:` v správe pre príjemcu."

#. module: l10n_cssk_payment_symbols_payment_order
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:l10n_cssk_payment_symbols_payment_order.field_account_payment_line__variable_symbol
msgid ""
"Czech/Slovak payment Variable Symbol (VS). Up to 10 digits. If empty, falls "
"back to a `VS:` token in the communication."
msgstr ""
"Variabilný symbol platby (VS). Najviac 10 číslic. Ak je prázdny, použije sa "
"údaj `VS:` v správe pre príjemcu."

